 class=\"huw-cutout-gallery\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\"><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Vinker\" controls=\"no\"/></div><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Stregmand – Vinker</strong><p>Led og underarme</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Vinker\">Afspil og redigér →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\"><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Går\" controls=\"no\"/></div><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Stregmand – Går</strong><p>Gangcyklus</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Går\">Afspil og redigér →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\"><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Hopper\" controls=\"no\"/></div><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Stregmand – Hopper</strong><p>Afsæt og landing</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Hopper\">Afspil og redigér →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\"><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Løber\" controls=\"no\"/></div><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Stregmand – Løber</strong><p>Løbecyklus</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Løber\">Afspil og redigér →</$link></div></div>\n</div>\n<hr/>\n<h2>Andre CutOut-eksempler</h2>\n\n\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-gallery\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Hoppende bold\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Hoppende bold</strong><p>Klassisk squash & stretch · tre hop</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Hoppende bold\">Afspil og redigér →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Pendulet\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Pendulet</strong><p>Drejepunkt og glidende bevægelse</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Pendulet\">Afspil og redigér →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"