\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Papirflyet\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Papirflyet</strong><p>En bane med flere nøglebilleder</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Papirflyet\">Afspil og redigér →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Levende typografi\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Levende typografi</strong><p>Roteret tekst med keyframes</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Levende typografi\">Afspil og redigér →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Bølger og båd\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Bølger og båd</strong><p>Flere lag med uafhængige animationer</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Bølger og båd\">Afspil og redigér →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Foto-collage\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Foto-collage</strong><p>Rasterfoto som baggrund med animeret SVG</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Foto-collage\">Afspil og redigér →</$link></div></div>\n</div>\n\n[[Hjælp og vejledning|HUWiki CutOut – Hjælp]]","en":"! CutOut 🎬\n\n''Små dele, levende historier.'' Seksten færdige animationer, der kan afspilles, undersøges og bygges videre på. Klik på et eksempel for at åbne editoren.\n\n<h2>Try Pivot-inspired stick figures</h2>\n<p>Four articulated figures with joints you can drag and rotate. Open an example and make your own animation.</p>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-gallery\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\"><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Vinker\" controls=\"no\"/></div><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Stick figure – Waving</strong><p>Joints and forearms</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Vinker\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\"><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Går\" controls=\"no\"/></div><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Stick figure – Walking</strong><p>Walk cycle</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Går\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\"><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Hopper\" controls=\"no\"/></div><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Stick figure – Jumping</strong><p>Take-off and landing</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Hopper\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\"><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Løber\" controls=\"no\"/></div><div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Stick figure – Running</strong><p>Run cycle</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Løber\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n</div>\n<hr/>\n<h2>More CutOut examples</h2>\n\n\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-gallery\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Hoppende bold\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Bouncing ball</strong><p>Classic squash and stretch · three bounces</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Hoppende bold\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Pendulet\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>The pendulum</strong><p>Pivot and smooth movement</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Pendulet\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – I kredsløb\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>In orbit</strong><p>Hierarchical movement and looping</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – I kredsløb\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Vinkende figur\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Waving figure</strong><p>Cut-out figure with arms and pivots</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Vinkende figur\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – På gåtur\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Out for a walk</strong><p>Walk cycle with independent tracks</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – På gåtur\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Fuglen flyver\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>The bird flies</strong><p>Two wings, motion path and layers</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Fuglen flyver\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Blomsten åbner sig\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>The flower opens</strong><p>Scaling, rotation and fading</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Blomsten åbner sig\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Vindmøllen\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>The windmill</strong><p>Groups, rotation and a shared centre</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Vindmøllen\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Papirflyet\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>The paper plane</strong><p>A path with several keyframes</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Papirflyet\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Levende typografi\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Living typography</strong><p>Rotating text with keyframes</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Levende typografi\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Bølger og båd\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Waves and boat</strong><p>Several layers with independent animations</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Bølger og båd\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card\">\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-art\"><$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Foto-collage\" controls=\"no\"/></div>\n<div class=\"huw-cutout-card-copy\"><strong>Photo collage</strong><p>Raster photo background with animated SVG</p><$link to=\"CutOut eksempel – Foto-collage\">Play and edit →</$link></div></div>\n</div>\n\n[[Help and guide|HUWiki CutOut – Hjælp]]"},"HUWiki CutOut – Hjælp":{"titleEn":"CutOut – Help","fields":{},"da":"! CutOut – Hjælp\n\n**Afspil:** `<$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Hoppende bold\"/>`\n\n**Indlejring uden afspilningsknapper:** `<$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Hoppende bold\" autoplay=\"yes\" loop=\"yes\" controls=\"no\"/>`\n\n**Redigér:** `<$cutout-editor tiddler=\"CutOut – Hoppende bold\"/>`\n\nEt objekt har ét spor på tidslinjen. Flyt tidsmarkøren, vælg et objekt og justér X, Y, rotation, størrelse eller synlighed. Der oprettes et nøglebillede. Afspilleren beregner automatisk mellemliggende positioner.\n\n**Rasterbilleder:** Importér et PNG/JPEG/WebP-billede som en almindelig billed-tiddler, opret et *Billede* i editoren, og skriv billed-tiddlerens titel. Brug helst billeder fra HUWikis eksisterende AV-import. Billeder med AV-referencer skal have en visningsbar billed-URL for at fungere i denne første version.\n\n**PasteUp:** Installer også den valgfrie PasteUp v0.1.7-kompatibilitetspakke. Opret et felt i din PasteUp med værdien `CutOut – Hoppende bold`; PasteUp viser da automatisk animationen i feltet. Den oprindelige PasteUp 0.1.6 ændres ikke af CutOut-pluginet.\n\n**Slideshow:** Indsæt afspiller-widgetten i en slide-tiddler. Brug `autoplay=\"yes\"`, hvis animationen skal starte, når slidet bliver synligt. Når slidet skjules, standses afspilningen.\n\n**Udgivelse:** Webafspilleren kræver TiddlyWikis widget-runtime. Selvstændig HTML-publicering af animationen er ikke implementeret i v0.1.0; den kommer som et valgfrit eksportmodul.\n\n**Begrænsninger i v0.1.0:** Audio, videoeksport, frit tegnede kurver, avanceret deformering, import fra SVG-filer er endnu ikke implementeret.\n\n[[Åbn CutOut Galleri|HUWiki CutOut – Galleri]]","en":"! CutOut help\nUse the player to play, pause and seek. The studio edits objects and their keyframes. One object has one track; changes to position, rotation, scale or opacity at the playhead create a point. The player interpolates between points.\n\nImport images as ordinary image tiddlers, or use the optional drawing editor for native sources. PasteUp compositions and slideshow pages can contain live CutOut players. Autoplay starts when a player becomes visible; hidden players stop running.\n\nUse the current Project and file and sharing controls to export viewing HTML/ZIP or publish a site. Keep the editable wiki and original sources separately. Capabilities described in older example notes may belong to earlier plugin versions.\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Hoppende bold\"/>\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"CutOut – Hoppende bold\" autoplay=\"yes\" loop=\"yes\" controls=\"no\"/>\n\n<$cutout-editor tiddler=\"CutOut – Hoppende bold\"/>\n\n* [[CutOut – Gallery|HUWiki CutOut – Galleri]]\n\n\n"},"Stregmand – Vinker":{"titleEn":"Stick figure – Waving","fields":{}},"CutOut eksempel – Vinker":{"titleEn":"CutOut example – Waving","fields":{},"da":"! Stregmand – Vinker\n\nLed og underarme · Pivot-inspirerede figurer med sammenkædede led.\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Vinker\" controls=\"yes\"/>\n\n!! Arbejd videre\n\nBrug Kopiér til ny tiddler for at bevare originalen. Klik på en arm eller et ben, og træk for at dreje leddet.\n\n<$cutout-editor tiddler=\"Stregmand – Vinker\"/>\n","en":"!! CutOut example – Waving\nPlay, pause and seek through the example. Try the editor, select a part and set a keyframe. Save project applies changes in the wiki; save the complete wiki to retain the editable sources.\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Vinker\" controls=\"yes\"/>\n\n<$cutout-editor tiddler=\"Stregmand – Vinker\"/>\n\n\n\n\n"},"Stregmand – Går":{"titleEn":"Stick figure – Walking","fields":{}},"CutOut eksempel – Går":{"titleEn":"CutOut example – Walking","fields":{},"da":"! Stregmand – Går\n\nGangcyklus · Pivot-inspirerede figurer med sammenkædede led.\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Går\" controls=\"yes\"/>\n\n!! Arbejd videre\n\nBrug Kopiér til ny tiddler for at bevare originalen. Klik på en arm eller et ben, og træk for at dreje leddet.\n\n<$cutout-editor tiddler=\"Stregmand – Går\"/>\n","en":"!! CutOut example – Walking\nPlay, pause and seek through the example. Try the editor, select a part and set a keyframe. Save project applies changes in the wiki; save the complete wiki to retain the editable sources.\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Går\" controls=\"yes\"/>\n\n<$cutout-editor tiddler=\"Stregmand – Går\"/>\n\n\n\n\n"},"Stregmand – Hopper":{"titleEn":"Stick figure – Jumping","fields":{}},"CutOut eksempel – Hopper":{"titleEn":"CutOut example – Jumping","fields":{},"da":"! Stregmand – Hopper\n\nAfsæt og landing · Pivot-inspirerede figurer med sammenkædede led.\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Hopper\" controls=\"yes\"/>\n\n!! Arbejd videre\n\nBrug Kopiér til ny tiddler for at bevare originalen. Klik på en arm eller et ben, og træk for at dreje leddet.\n\n<$cutout-editor tiddler=\"Stregmand – Hopper\"/>\n","en":"!! CutOut example – Jumping\nPlay, pause and seek through the example. Try the editor, select a part and set a keyframe. Save project applies changes in the wiki; save the complete wiki to retain the editable sources.\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Hopper\" controls=\"yes\"/>\n\n<$cutout-editor tiddler=\"Stregmand – Hopper\"/>\n\n\n\n\n"},"Stregmand – Løber":{"titleEn":"Stick figure – Running","fields":{}},"CutOut eksempel – Løber":{"titleEn":"CutOut example – Running","fields":{},"da":"! Stregmand – Løber\n\nLøbecyklus · Pivot-inspirerede figurer med sammenkædede led.\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Løber\" controls=\"yes\"/>\n\n!! Arbejd videre\n\nBrug Kopiér til ny tiddler for at bevare originalen. Klik på en arm eller et ben, og træk for at dreje leddet.\n\n<$cutout-editor tiddler=\"Stregmand – Løber\"/>\n","en":"!! CutOut example – Running\nPlay, pause and seek through the example. Try the editor, select a part and set a keyframe. Save project applies changes in the wiki; save the complete wiki to retain the editable sources.\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"Stregmand – Løber\" controls=\"yes\"/>\n\n<$cutout-editor tiddler=\"Stregmand – Løber\"/>\n\n\n\n\n"},"Teater – Scene 1 · Morgen":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 1 · Morning","fields":{"caption":{"da":"Teater – Scene 1 · Morgen","en":"Theatre – Scene 1 · Morning"}}},"Teater – Scene 1 · Morgen/Layout":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 1 · Morning/Layout","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Scene 1 · Morgen/Styles":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 1 · Morning/Styles","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Scene 1 · Morgen/Actions":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 1 · Morning/Actions","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Scene 2 · Mødet":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 2 · The meeting","fields":{"caption":{"da":"Teater – Scene 2 · Mødet","en":"Theatre – Scene 2 · The meeting"}}},"Teater – Scene 2 · Mødet/Layout":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 2 · The meeting/Layout","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Scene 2 · Mødet/Styles":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 2 · The meeting/Styles","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Scene 2 · Mødet/Actions":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 2 · The meeting/Actions","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Scene 3 · Aften":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 3 · Evening","fields":{"caption":{"da":"Teater – Scene 3 · Aften","en":"Theatre – Scene 3 · Evening"}}},"Teater – Scene 3 · Aften/Layout":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 3 · Evening/Layout","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Scene 3 · Aften/Styles":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 3 · Evening/Styles","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Scene 3 · Aften/Actions":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 3 · Evening/Actions","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Ramme":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Frame","fields":{"caption":{"da":"Teater – Ramme","en":"Theatre – Frame"}}},"Teater – Ramme/Layout":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Frame/Layout","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Ramme/Styles":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Frame/Styles","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Ramme/Actions":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Frame/Actions","fields":{},"da":"","en":""},"Teater – Tre små øjeblikke":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Three little moments","fields":{"caption":{"da":"Tre små øjeblikke (16 sek.)","en":"Three little moments (16 seconds)"}}},"Teater – Scene 1 · Morgen/Motion":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 1 · Morning/Motion","fields":{"caption":{"da":"CutOut bevægelser over PasteUp-elementer","en":"CutOut movement over PasteUp elements"}}},"Teater – Scene 2 · Mødet/Motion":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 2 · The meeting/Motion","fields":{"caption":{"da":"CutOut bevægelser over PasteUp-elementer","en":"CutOut movement over PasteUp elements"}}},"Teater – Scene 3 · Aften/Motion":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scene 3 · Evening/Motion","fields":{"caption":{"da":"CutOut bevægelser over PasteUp-elementer","en":"CutOut movement over PasteUp elements"}}},"Teater – Scener som slideshow":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Scenes as slideshow","fields":{"caption":{"da":"Samme tre PasteUps – som Slideshow","en":"The same three PasteUps – as a Slideshow"}}},"HUWiki Teater – Start":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Home","fields":{"caption":{"da":"Et rigtigt teater bygget af PasteUps","en":"A real theatre built from PasteUps"}},"da":"\\import $:/plugins/huwiki/pasteup/Engine/Embed\n! Teater 🎭\n\n''En PasteUp-ramme omkring tre redigerbare PasteUp-scener – med CutOut-dukker indeni.''\n\n<$macrocall $name=pasteUpEmbed tiddler=\"Teater – Ramme\" copy=\"no\" allowdrag=\"no\" tooltip=\"no\"/>\n\n!! Åbn og undersøg\n\n* [[CutOut – Galleri|HUWiki CutOut – Galleri]] – de 16 færdige, redigerbare animationseksempler.\n* [[Teater – Ramme]] – redigér teatrets yderste PasteUp.\n* [[Teater – Scene 1 · Morgen]] – solen stiger op, skyerne flytter sig, dukken går.\n* [[Teater – Scene 2 · Mødet]] – to CutOut-dukker i samme scene.\n* [[Teater – Scene 3 · Aften]] – afslutningen.\n* [[Teater – Tre små øjeblikke]] – redigér rækkefølge og varighed.\n* [[Teater – Scener som slideshow]] – den samme gruppe PasteUps i Slideshow.\n\n!! Sådan er det bygget\n\nDe tre scener er almindelige PasteUp-tiddlers. Deres farver, tekst og placeringer ændres i PasteUp. Animationen af et scenefelt gemmes ''separat'' i scenens `/Motion`-tiddler. CutOut-dukkerne er selvstændige CutOut-tiddlers, som PasteUp refererer til. Teatret styrer sceneskift ved 5 + 6 + 5 sekunder.\n\nFor at ændre scenens bevægelser kan du prøve at redigere dens `'/Motion'`-tiddler: Feltnavne følger scenens normale PasteUp-feltnavne. Denne første Teater-version har endnu ikke en visuel tidslinje for PasteUp-felter.\n\n''Plugins i denne testwiki:'' [[CutOut|$:/plugins/huwiki/cutout]] · [[PasteUp Forge|$:/plugins/huwiki/pasteup]] · [[Teater|$:/plugins/huwiki/theatre]] · [[Slideshow|$:/plugins/huwiki/slideshow]].\n","en":"! A theatre built from PasteUps\nThis legacy theatre combines three PasteUp scenes with one shared playback clock. Play, pause and seek through the show, then inspect the scene sources. The newer CutOut Theatre studio also supports shared objects and camera keyframes.\n\n\n\n* [[$:/plugins/huwiki/cutout|$:/plugins/huwiki/cutout]]\n* [[$:/plugins/huwiki/pasteup|$:/plugins/huwiki/pasteup]]\n* [[$:/plugins/huwiki/theatre|$:/plugins/huwiki/theatre]]\n* [[$:/plugins/huwiki/slideshow|$:/plugins/huwiki/slideshow]]\n\n\n"},"HUWiki Teater – Arkitektur":{"titleEn":"Theatre – Architecture","fields":{},"da":"! Modulært 🎭\n\n* Teatret har sin egen tiddler med listen over scener og varighed.\n* Hver scene er en redigerbar PasteUp.\n* Hver animation er stadig en selvstændig CutOut-tiddler.\n* En PasteUp-kulisse kan animeres med `/Motion` uden at ændre dens grundlayout.\n* Teaterrammen er selv en PasteUp; forestillingen er kun et af dens elementer.\n* Slideshow kan arbejde med de samme scenetiddlers uden at være nødvendig for selve CutOut-pluginet.\n\n''Bemærk:'' Den første prototype bruger direkte sceneskift (ingen fuldt verificeret overlap/crossfade endnu). Hele PasteUp-rammen forbliver monteret ved sceneskift.\n","en":"! Theatre architecture\nA show contains a sequence of scenes. Each scene has a duration, source offset and speed. One outer clock seeks the embedded players, so nested content follows the show’s current time. Scene motion can animate the surrounding PasteUp elements. Source titles and stable IDs keep the references intact.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n"},"Demo – Milo (dukke)":{"titleEn":"Demo – Milo (puppet)","fields":{}},"Demo – Vink":{"titleEn":"Demo – Wave","fields":{}},"Demo – Dobbeltvink":{"titleEn":"Demo – Nested wave","fields":{}},"Demo – Scene A":{"titleEn":"Demo – Scene A","fields":{}},"Demo – Scene B":{"titleEn":"Demo – Scene B","fields":{}},"Demo – Forestilling":{"titleEn":"Demo – Forestilling","fields":{}},"Demo – Teaterfront":{"titleEn":"Demo – Theatre front","fields":{}},"HUWiki CutOut – Teaterkulisser":{"titleEn":"CutOut – Theatre scenery","fields":{},"da":"! Kulisserne er redigerbare\n\nByhusene, himlen, porten, træscenen og teaterfronten er egne billeddele med native Excalidraw-kilder.\n\nÅbn Scenestudiet og vælg »Morgen i kulissebyen«, »Lys i vinduerne« eller »Teaterfront · ramme og tæppefald«. Vælg en billeddel og »Redigér rekvisit i Excalidraw«. Tæppebevægelserne ligger i Teaterfrontens nøglebilleder.\n\nDe samme kulisser medfølger som almindelige `.excalidraw`-filer i Demoer/Kulisser.\n\n[[Åbn værkstederne|HUWiki CutOut – Studio]]","en":"! Editable scenery\nThe town houses, sky, gate, wooden stage and theatre front are separate image parts with native Excalidraw sources.\n\nOpen the Scene studio and choose the morning scene, the evening scene or the theatre-front project. Select an image part and edit its prop in Excalidraw. Curtain movement is stored in the theatre front’s keyframes. The same scenery is available as ordinary .excalidraw source files in the original package.\n\n\n\n* [[Open the workshops|HUWiki CutOut – Studio]]\n\n\n"},"Demo – Kameratur":{"titleEn":"Demo – Camera tour","fields":{}},"Demo – Programside":{"titleEn":"Demo – Programme page","fields":{},"da":"! Milos lille teater\n\nHer kan du se hele forestillingen med dens kameratur.\n\n<$cutout-film tiddler=\"Demo – Kameratur\" loop=\"no\"/>\n\n!! Et vink fra Milo\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"Demo – Vink\" loop=\"no\"/>","en":"! Milo’s little theatre\nWatch the complete show and its camera movement below, followed by a wave from Milo. These are live animation players embedded in an ordinary content page.\n\n<$cutout-film tiddler=\"Demo – Kameratur\" loop=\"no\"/>\n\n<$cutout tiddler=\"Demo – Vink\" loop=\"no\"/>\n\n\n\n\n"},"HUWiki CutOut – Kamerademo":{"titleEn":"CutOut – Camera demo","fields":{},"da":"! En kameratur gennem to scener\n\nKameraet starter bredt, går tættere på og fortsætter gennem sceneskiftet ved 8 sekunder. Prøv også at søge baglæns.\n\n<$cutout-film tiddler=\"Demo – Kameratur\" loop=\"no\"/>\n\n[[Redigér kamerasporet i vejledningen|HUWiki CutOut – Vejledning/Kamera]]","en":"! A camera journey through two scenes\nThe camera starts wide, moves closer and continues through the scene change at eight seconds. Try seeking backwards as well. Open the camera exercise to edit its track.\n\n<$cutout-film tiddler=\"Demo – Kameratur\" loop=\"no\"/>\n\n* [[CutOut – Guide/Camera|HUWiki CutOut – Vejledning/Kamera]]\n\n\n"},"HUWiki CutOut – Studio":{"titleEn":"CutOut – Studio","fields":{},"da":"<$cutout-studio/>\n","en":"<$cutout-studio/>\n"},"HUWiki CutOut – Ny afspilning":{"titleEn":"CutOut – New playback","fields":{},"da":"! Fire niveauer, ét ur\n\nTeater → scene → dobbeltanimation → dukkeanimation. To animationer kører samtidig; gæsten kommer ind efter to sekunder.\n\n<$cutout-theatre tiddler=\"Demo – Forestilling\" loop=\"no\"/>\n\n[[Åbn de fire arbejdsrum|HUWiki CutOut – Studio]]","en":"! Four levels, one clock\nTheatre → scene → nested animation → puppet animation. Two animations run together; the visitor enters after two seconds. Open the four workspaces to explore the sources.\n\n<$cutout-theatre tiddler=\"Demo – Forestilling\" loop=\"no\"/>\n\n* [[Open the four workspaces|HUWiki CutOut – Studio]]\n\n\n"},"HUWiki CutOut – Ældre bevægelser":{"titleEn":"CutOut – Legacy movement","fields":{},"da":"! Redigér oprindelige PasteUp-bevægelser\n\n<$cutout-motion-editor tiddler=\"Teater – Scene 1 · Morgen/Motion\"/>\n\n<$cutout-motion-editor tiddler=\"Teater – Scene 2 · Mødet/Motion\"/>\n\n<$cutout-motion-editor tiddler=\"Teater – Scene 3 · Aften/Motion\"/>","en":"! Edit original PasteUp movement\nThese are the legacy movement editors for the three original PasteUp scenes. Save movement applies the changes in the wiki; also save the whole editable wiki to retain them on disk.\n\n<$cutout-motion-editor tiddler=\"Teater – Scene 1 · Morgen/Motion\"/>\n\n<$cutout-motion-editor tiddler=\"Teater – Scene 2 · Mødet/Motion\"/>\n\n<$cutout-motion-editor tiddler=\"Teater – Scene 3 · Aften/Motion\"/>\n\n\n\n\n"},"HUWiki CutOut – Start":{"titleEn":"CutOut – Home","fields":{},"da":"! CutOut\n\nFire arbejdsrum til dukker, animationer, scener og forestillinger.\n\nDenne udgave er en ''testkandidat (0.6.0-rc1)''. Se TESTRAPPORT.txt i pakken for afprøvede forløb og begrænsninger.\n\n* [[Følg en hel animation · fra dukke til forestilling|HUWiki CutOut – Hele forløbet]]\n* [[Åbn værkstederne|HUWiki CutOut – Studio]]\n* [[Dansk vejledning|HUWiki CutOut – Vejledning]]\n* [[Værkbibliotek og publicering|HUWiki CutOut – Del]]\n\n<details><summary>Flere demonstrationer og ældre eksempler</summary>\n\n* [[Se den nye demonstration|HUWiki CutOut – Ny afspilning]]\n* [[Prøv kameraets bevægelse|HUWiki CutOut – Kamerademo]]\n* [[Redigér teaterkulisserne|HUWiki CutOut – Teaterkulisser]]\n* [[Oprindeligt galleri|HUWiki CutOut – Galleri]]\n* [[Oprindeligt PasteUp-teater|HUWiki Teater – Start]]\n* [[Redigér ældre scenebevægelser|HUWiki CutOut – Ældre bevægelser]]\n\n</details>\n\n<$cutout-theatre tiddler=\"Demo – Forestilling\" loop=\"no\"/>\n","en":"! CutOut\n\nFour connected workspaces for puppets, animations, scenes and shows. Build your own moving world, explore the examples, and keep ownership of the editable sources.\n\nChoose the complete walkthrough, open the workshops, browse the guide, or prepare a finished work for sharing. The demonstration below is a real player: try Play, Pause, the playhead and the scene buttons.\n\n<$cutout-theatre tiddler=\"Demo – Forestilling\" loop=\"no\"/>\n\n* [[Follow a complete animation · from puppet to show|HUWiki CutOut – Hele forløbet]]\n* [[Open the workshops|HUWiki CutOut – Studio]]\n* [[Guide|HUWiki CutOut – Vejledning]]\n* [[Works library and publishing|HUWiki CutOut – Del]]\n* [[View the new demonstration|HUWiki CutOut – Ny afspilning]]\n* [[Try camera movement|HUWiki CutOut – Kamerademo]]\n* [[Edit the theatre scenery|HUWiki CutOut – Teaterkulisser]]\n* [[Original gallery|HUWiki CutOut – Galleri]]\n* [[Original PasteUp theatre|HUWiki Teater – Start]]\n* [[Edit legacy scene movement|HUWiki CutOut – Ældre bevægelser]]\n\n\n"},"Øvelse · Overblik / Demo – Forestilling":{"titleEn":"Exercise · Overview / Demo – Forestilling","fields":{}},"Øvelse · Overblik / Demo – Teaterfront":{"titleEn":"Exercise · Overview / Demo – Theatre front","fields":{}},"Øvelse · Overblik / Demo – Scene A":{"titleEn":"Exercise · Overv